→ Encounter → Post-Round → Pre-Round, Back, re-tap opens Pre-Round again","fullName":"TC-01 Patient Chart Card › TC-01/S09"},"descriptionHtml":"<div class=\"rc-approach\"><p><b>思路 / Approach</b> · TC-01 Patient Chart Card · <b>S09</b> 「病历里：Pre-Round → Encounter → Post-Round → Pre-Round，返回，再点一次又打开 Pre-Round」 <span class=\"notranslate\" translate=\"no\" lang=\"en\">Inside the chart: Pre-Round → Encounter → Post-Round → Pre-Round, Back, re-tap opens Pre-Round again</span></p><p><b>覆盖的 UAT 步骤 / 票 AC：</b></p><ul><li><b>T4</b> From within a patient's chart, Encounter and Post-Round are both reachable without returning to the home screen first.（TFA-92579 AC 6）</li><li><b>U7</b> Tapping a card opens that exact patient's Pre-Round view.（UAT TC-01；TFA-92579 AC 5）</li></ul><p><b>测试设计方法：</b>状态迁移（state-transition） — 按先后顺序走（加 → 改 → 删、第 1 天 → 第 2 天、离线 → 在线），每一步之后看状态对不对。</p><p><b>Given </b>Standard fixture (no note generated yet)</p><p><b>When </b>Open a card, use the tab strip through all three tabs and back to Pre-Round, press browser Back, tap the same card again; same in Nursing Home</p><p><b>Then </b>Every tab is reachable without going home, the header stays on the same patient, Back returns to the list, and the re-tap opens Pre-Round (Q10)</p><p><b>通过的标准（oracle，节选）：</b>oracle.mjs: every chart checkpoint mustContain the same patient's name and 'Admission status' (chart header) and not the other context's patient; Encounter mustContain 'Encounter Notes'; Post-Round mustContain 'No note generated yet.' (the Post-Round tab body on a fresh fixture, both contexts) and mustNotContain 'Encounter Notes' and 'pre-round notes'; …</p><p><b>在哪跑：</b>dev 单元 U25；测试方法 AGENT · 浏览器 agent；矩阵里排的车道 浏览器 agent（automated）</p><p><small>S09 是我们自己编的用例号（覆盖矩阵 cases/TC-01.matrix.json 里的编号），不是 UAT 文档里的步骤号。</small></p></div><p><b>环境：dev</b> — dev 部署，build <code>e02167f</code>（Deploy Convex，2026-10-12T18:24:27Z）；账号和地址不写进报告；run folder <code>runs/2026-10-14-dev</code>。</p><p><b>测试方法：</b>AGENT · 浏览器 agent；辅助：PW · Playwright 脚本 — 按 cases/test-methods.json 的分类，分类说在 both 跑；来源：<code>dev</code>。</p><p><b>UAT item:</b> TC-01 Patient Chart Card · <b>Section:</b> A1 · Home Screen &amp; Dashboard · <b>Scenario:</b> TC-01/S09</p><p><b>Inside the chart: Pre-Round → Encounter → Post-Round → Pre-Round, Back, re-tap opens Pre-Round again</b></p><p><b>Tickets:</b> TFA-92579 Home Screen: Patient Chart Card (ready for qa)</p><p><b>Result:</b> Pass from <code>scripts/oracle.mjs</code> on the saved evidence (<code>units/U25.verdict.json</code>), unit U25 split by its parts' checkpoints. Agent: 97 turns, 262 s, $0.77.</p><p><b>Plan:</b> unit U25 (#25, ready-for-qa, ui-only) — Chart tabs of a patient with no notes. Same legacy seed, same chart tabs. EFS S02 and TC-16 S08 both check the 'patient with no notes yet' state (TC-16 S08 cites UAT EFS state 2) on the same Encounter tab, with different checks, so they share the setup instead of being duplicates. TC-01 S09 only moves between the same tabs. Runs together with EFS/S02, TC-16/S08.</p><p><b>Checked by Quinn's runner</b> (<code>ledger.md</code> #25, U25; checked: yes): <b>Pass</b> — empty states on all three tabs, both modes, no error/invented content. Explains the U29 observation: Post-Round always shows a disabled 'Finalizing Encounter Data…' button when there is no note — not stuck, but the wording reads as 'in progress' (UX copy, needs a human; EFS 'tell the physician what to do next')</p>","environment":"default","setup":[],"teardown":[],"history":[],"retries":[],"breadcrumbs":[["TC-01 Patient Chart Card","S09 Inside the chart: Pre-Round → Encounter → Post-Round → Pre-Round, Back, re-tap opens Pre-Round again"]],"retry":false,"titlePath":[],"retriesCount":0,"attachments":[{"link":{"used":true,"missed":false,"id":"152dc544b0b5f830c51935b59ad9c303","originalFileName":"e1cd10ad-8074-47ca-8f50-e95ae89e32d1-attachment.txt","ext":".txt","contentType":"text/plain","contentLength":2717,"name":"page snapshot (accessibility tree)"},"type":"attac